Terrible Mouse Fan Project Rules 🐭

1. Do not share your real passwords.
2. Do not upload real account passwords.
3. Hide your email address and private information.
4. These password examples are for fun and creativity only.
5. Create your own unique passwords for your accounts.
6. Do not copy another person’s password.
7. Respect all Terrible Mouse fans and non-fans.
8. Enjoy the Terrible Mouse community safely.